User: Let $ABCD$ be a convex quadrilateral, and let $G_A,$ $G_B,$ $G_C,$ $G_D$ denote the centroids of triangles $BCD,$ $ACD,$ $ABD,$ and $ABC,$ respectively.  Find $\frac{[G_A G_B G_C G_D]}{[ABCD]}.$

